## 🚀 Vision

Neuro-AI is building an AI that **understands neurodivergence** — ADHD, autism, dyslexia, and combinations — using both:

* **Science data** (papers, orgs, validated knowledge).
* **Lived data** (stories, forums, advocacy voices).

The demo clients prove the **pipeline works** end-to-end and set us up for squad playtesting + funder confidence.

